body: |-
  RECLASSIFICATION (the actionable output of round 2):

  BUILD NOW (real defect in shipped code, the literal gate): T-2026-06-23-003 absorb worktree concurrency. Cid VERIFIED the load-bearing fact — premise-core's loadLiveGraph + the lens do pure fs reads, never shell git inside the lifted tree (grep: only git-exec.ts touches child_process). So `git archive <ref> | tar -x` into a temp dir kills the .git/worktrees lock cleanly. Plan: materializeTree/releaseTree (stream not shell-pipe, preserve no-shell arg-array hardening; rev-parse to a SHA first), per-repo in-process mutex for the cold mergeTree fallback (which needs a real worktree — archive can't serve it). ACCEPTANCE: flip vitest fileParallelism:true + N=4 concurrent-absorb test green + an invariant guard test (no git subprocess with cwd inside a materialized tree). Unblocks T-012.

  DESIGN-CONSTRAINTS ON THE WRITE-PATH BUILD (capture as "build the write path THIS way", do NOT parallel-build as standalone features — Jinx's one concession):
  - T-016 CAS admission: per-symbol-DOMAIN optimistic CAS on the selvage tip; snapshot trust+fragility+WEAVE-LAW-version AT the evaluated tip, FREEZE into the WeaveRecord (kills the scrutiny-read-to-admit TOCTOU; the loser re-predicts against the winner's tip so the manufactured-post-hoc-knot can't happen). Canonical domain lock-ordering (shared with consolidate's topo-sort) avoids deadlock; FIFO admission ticket + non-conflicting coalescing avoids hot-symbol livelock. Make `warpline queue` the MANDATORY admission path. Hot fragile symbol = correctly serialized, NOT parallelized (honest scope: "neutral for DEEP-OVERLAP").
  - T-013 injection: typed untrusted-prose envelope (content-addressed kind tag) → sentinel-escaped frame-on-render → trust-scoped quarantine-render; gate decision = pure function of signed/computed inputs, never prose. Warpline owns envelope+frame+contract; runtime owns honoring it (advisory per CLAUDE.md → needs tool-permission backing). Twin test = the falsifiable proof. Co-design with T-015 (content) + T-017 (render-trust for seeds).
  - Arky's weft + scratch primitives: WEFT = atomic content-addressed PICK-GROUP, closure computed by Tarjan SCC over the dependency graph (cyclic dependency ⇒ atomic group is FORCED by the math, not declared — reuse essence-hash.ts SCC), all-or-nothing admission. SCRATCH = ephemeral owner-private MUTABLE view (folds in GAP-2 shelf); scratch=ownership/not-ready, quarantine=trust/don't-trust-you — must not conflate.
  - T-014 (the REAL slice): structural essence for JSON/YAML (key-path set → disjoint adds COMMUTE, same-key-diff-value KNOTS); lockfiles + generated files = REGENERATE-not-merge behind a determinism contract (pin generator + verify byte-reproducibility in CI), NOT structural-merge (a structurally-merged lockfile installs but is invalid = green footgun); T3 coverage triple per file makes byte-blob fallback HONEST (reported number) not hidden. The test-assertion lens is RESEARCH (semantic equivalence of test intent = the hardest core), NOT a v1 fix — Jinx correctly flagged it as GAP-1+T-015 in a trenchcoat.

  NEEDS-DATA / RESEARCH (don't score as "designed"): T-017 cold-start ladder — build Rung C (shadow-earned) FIRST (only rung that manufactures evidence; safe-by-construction; the instrument that generates data for A's τ_seed/λ/K and B's prior_weight). Rung B (archetype prior) is CONDITIONAL — drop if cross-population data shows the notebook-hash prior predicts nothing (Jinx: astrology until cohort-homogeneity proven). Jinx's shadow-earned critique stands: it may RELOCATE human cost (review shadow runs instead of clearing quarantine) — must show net reduction. T-015 static danger-signal coefficients = educated priors needing the field-failure distribution of statically-seeded-but-history-clean symbols.

  MAKE-US-BETTER (recursive dogfood) — only real with FALSIFIABLE ARTIFACTS:
  - Intent board (T-new): theater unless a logged agent decision changed by a board read (collision-rate in stream.jsonl before/after). This session = first datum (round-2 agents had overlapping territory).
  - Injection hardening: theater unless a BLIND externally-authored, human-scored red-team corpus (seen + unseen payloads) flips zero verdicts (added as T-013 acceptance criterion).
  - Loid's highest-leverage: run the Warpline arc as a live Classroom term — every decision provisional, peer-refuted, certified/killed against our own subsequent merges via the field-failure reducer pointed at our own work. GUARD (Jinx): needs an OUTSIDE-LOOP metric / exogenous signal or it's the closed loop the Classroom poison-pill exists to prevent. Aegis's parallel: frame agent-to-agent orchestrator handoffs as UPSTREAM_AGENT_OUTPUT data + tag repo-sourced prose UNTRUSTED_REPO_PROSE (the orchestrator currently feeds one agent's raw output to the next unframed — same vuln as the weft channel, internal scale).

  CONFIDENCE SPREAD: Arky 0.62 (GAP-1 solvable to fan-out claim), Cid 0.78 (parallel flow shippable; measurement risk on labor_ratio<1), Aegis 0.78 (security holds once T-013+T-016 land; residual = advisory runtime adoption + semantic injection below the frame), Loid 0.45 (architecture ~0.8, safe-at-scale dragged down by 4 guessed parameters needing swarm data), Jinx 0.3 (real improvement vs satisfying conversation — moves to 0.6 IFF absorb-fix+write-path+contended-fixture built first AND a blind red-team artifact attached). Converged: architecture sound (~0.8), product unproven (~0.5) until the write path runs and the contended fixture measures < git.
